---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-cream p-8 sm:p-10">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
    <span class="inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-teal text-white"><Icon name="pill" class="h-6 w-6" /></span>
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-teal">Psychiatric partner</p>
      <p class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal">Telemed Clinix</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-5 text-charcoal">
    Psychiatric evaluation and medication management come through our referral partnership with Telemed Clinix: MDs, ARNPs and PAs who understand addiction and dual diagnosis. You meet your provider virtually from a private office on our property, and prescriptions go straight to the pharmacy you choose.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3 text-charcoal">
    <strong class="text-charcoal">It doesn’t stop at discharge.</strong> You can keep seeing the same Telemed Clinix provider after you finish at Sunview, so your care has continuity.
  </p>
</div>
